# eTactica EM-SC/EM-FC.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | eTactica EM-SC / EM-FC Power Meter (Modbus RTU RS-485)
# | 
# | Source: etactica-power-meter-em-modbus-register-map.pdf (v2.1, 2018-04-10)
# | Models: EM-SC (split-core current sensors), EM-FC (flexible-coil current sensors)
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU; FC03 read holding registers, FC16 write multiple registers
# | Default RS-485: 19200 baud, 8 data bits, Even parity, 1 stop bit (firmware ≥3.2 configurable)
# | Default Modbus slave ID: last byte of serial number (configurable via 0x2009)
# | 
# | ADDRESSING: All addresses in this file are native PDU addresses (0-based).
# | Register 0x2000 = decimal 8192. Some tools show these as 48193 (Modicon holding register).
# | DATA FORMAT: Big-Endian, MSB first. Unsigned 16-bit unless noted.
# | Size-2 registers: u32 stored in 2 consecutive registers (MSB first).
# | Size-4 registers: signed 64-bit stored in 4 consecutive registers (MSB first);
# | represented here as two u32 entries: (high 32-bit) at base, (low 32-bit) at base+2.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=eTactica
@model=EM-SC/EM-FC
@vendor_website=bms-systems.co.uk
@description=3-phase power meter (split-core or flexible-coil CTs), Modbus RTU. Base address 0x2000 (=8192 decimal). Common: vendor/product/firmware IDs, command, comms settings at 8192-8206. EM-specific: frequency at 8207 (mHz); phase currents at 8208-8211 (mA, u32); phase voltages at 8214-8218 (mV, u32); per-phase PF at 8222-8224 (×100); status at 8225; CT full-scale at 8226; cumulative energy at 8232 (mWh, s64) and reactive at 8239 (mVArh, s64). EM2 extended (fw≥4.0): 1-sec and 60-sec RMS averages, per-phase energy counters (µWh/µVArh, s64) at 8449-8549; last-cycle values and per-phase PF signs at 8536-8553.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/etactica-em-sc-fc.toml; Source: etactica-power-meter-em-modbus-register-map.pdf (v2.1, 2018-04-10). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

